OL,3,GNEWSA'Calm space' installed at busy
OL,4,ATube station
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new "calm space" is being trialled at
OL,7,Fa west London Tube and railway station,
OL,8,Faimed at helping passengers who find
OL,9,Ftravelling overwhelming.
OL,11,FThe space at Ealing Broadway station
OL,12,Fprovides a welcoming, low-stimulation
OL,13,Fenvironment where customers can take
OL,14,Ftime out to pause and rest, Transport
OL,15,Ffor London (TfL) says.
OL,17,FIt has an acoustic shelter designed to
OL,18,Freduce surrounding noise, a comfortable
OL,19,Fseat, and is decorated with calming
OL,20,Fimages of nature and plants.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
